  "body": "Vendor has brought unconditionally, get in quick! \r\n\r\nPositioned to capture all-day north-east sun, 23 Sunnyheights Road offers thoughtfully designed, spacious multi-level family living. With a clever layout that separates vehicle access, entertaining, and private sleeping quarters, this four-bedroom home delivers effortless everyday practicality alongside relaxed coastal style.\r\n\r\nA standout feature is the property's dual road access. On the ground floor, the large double garage is accessed via a second road entrance, keeping cars and daily comings-and-goings completely separate from the main living entrance and outdoor spaces..\r\n\r\nThe first level is dedicated to living, hosting, and convenience. At its heart sits a well-appointed kitchen paired with a scullery featuring a 2nd gas cooktop and 2nd sink - ideal for keeping the main space clutter-free when entertaining. Floor-to-ceiling stacking doors glide open to connect the living zone seamlessly to a private, decked outdoor entertaining area. Fully fenced, it provides a safe, sun-drenched haven for summer barbecues, children, and pets. A second separate living area on this level adds valuable versatility for movie nights, guests, or a kids' lounge.\r\n\r\nHead upstairs to the top floor, where all four double bedrooms are peacefully tucked away from the hub of the home. To compliment the family living, the home is complete with a bath and underfloor heating. The master suite is a standout retreat, complete with a large walk-in wardrobe and elevated sea view to wake up to every morning. \r\n\r\nDesigned by the award winning Kiwi team at Creative Arch, this home proves you can have genuine architectural style without the weekend maintenance.\r\n\r\nBuilt from solid concrete block, brick, and James Hardie panels, this place is made to last. Thanks to its north east aspect, natural light pours through the floor to ceiling windows from morning till evening. \r\n\r\nZoned for the highly regarded Nukumea Primary School and Orewa College, and just minutes from Orewa Beach, local cafes, and motorway access, this is a home that ticks every box for modern family life.\r\n\r\nWhat you will love:\r\n* Smart three-level design: Ground-floor garaging, first-level living with indoor/outdoor entertaining, and top-floor bedrooms\r\n* Dual road entrances: Second entrance leads directly to the large carpeted double garage, keeping vehicles and living access completely separate\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow: Floor-to-ceiling stacking doors opening onto a decked, fully fenced entertaining area\r\n* Two generous living areas: Giving families, teenagers or guests room to spread out and unwind\r\n* Entertainer's kitchen: Stone Benchtop with Island & Scullery equipped with its own gas cooktop and sink\r\n* 4 double bedrooms upstairs: Master suite featuring ensuite,  sea views and a large walk-in wardrobe.  \r\n* 2 fully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating and LED mirrors (a treat on chilly winter mornings). Bath to soak away the day.\r\n* All-day sun & comfort: North-east aspect streaming with natural light\r\n* Everyday luxuries including ducted heating & cooling, central vacuum system, burglar alarm and continuous gas hot water\r\n\r\nHomes offering this level of sun, indoor-outdoor flow, and dual-entrance convenience are rarely available in Orewa. Get in touch today to arrange a private viewing or visit us at the open home.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing & Sale Details:\r\n\r\nSet Date Sale - 15 December 2026 (Unless Sold Prior)",
